  "prefLabel": "Env-A 702.04 Permit-by-Notification Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 702.04 Permit-by-Notification Fee. The owner or operator of a statutory source, area source, or device that applies for a permit-by-notification pursuant to Env-A 603.02 shall submit to the department a fee of $1,000 with the permit application.\n\nSource. #9792, eff 10-1-10; ss by #9911, eff 4-26-11; ss by #12649, eff 10-24-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a700.html"
